# ===========================================================================
# AI / AGENT ARTEFACTS — NEVER COMMITTED. NO EXCEPTIONS.
#
# This repo is PUBLIC, and everything in src/ and content/ is compiled into
# dist/ and served to visitors. "Committed" and "published" are the same act.
#
# AI working files carry product context the shipped site deliberately does
# not: unannounced content, roadmap, embargoed decisions, and the reasoning
# behind them. That includes REVIEWS and AUDITS, which are the worst offenders
# — a review enumerates every known gap and unshipped plan in one file.
#
# The rule is CATEGORY-based, not filename-based: if a tool or a model wrote
# it for us rather than for visitors, it does not belong in this repo. It
# lives in the separate private repo. See PORT-NOTES.md.
#
# Adding a new tool? Add its files here FIRST, before you run it.
# ===========================================================================

